nk-type="pubmed">Vol. 146, No. 4, August 23, 1999. Pages 791&#x02013;800.</related-article></p><p>Drs. Tanaka, Yasuda, and Todokoro retract the above referenced manuscript. An investigation by RIKEN determined that some of the experimental data had been falsified. Details of the investigation are available at <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.riken.jp/r-world/info/release/press/2004/041224/index_e.html">http://www.riken.jp/r-world/info/release/press/2004/041224/index_e.html</ext-link>.</p></body></article>